{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Finance input invocation schema v1",
  "description": "Stable entry point previus_core::finance::run_finance(tool,input), also routed by previus_core::run_tool. Mathematical operator parameters only; no legal tables or eligibility claims. This schema documents structure; runtime also validates bounds and semantic consistency. All examples synthetic.",
