      "description": "11 operations. payment/loan_schedule/rate_from_values require periods>0; money nonnegative; rates>-100%; loan_schedule rate>=0. Exponential/annuity computations use disclosed f64 approximation with finite/overflow checks. Simple interest uses exact integer ratios."
